      "content": "i know there are hotlines, i've seen them, but they don't change the fact that he's not coming back. it feels like i'm just waiting for the clock to run out. sometimes i sit there thinking that the silence would be even better if i just... stopped fighting it. like, why keep up this performance of living when there's nothing left to live for?",
