      "content": "it just feels like i'm stuck in this halfway point. like i'm neither here nor there. it feels so unnatural to be the only thing left of us, you know? it's like the connection was severed and i'm just a ghost wandering around in a house that isn't mine anymore. it would be so much easier to just be done with the struggle and be where he is. it almost feels like the only way to actually be at peace would be to close the door on all of this.",
